sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as Cliente
    participant OS as OS Service / Orchestrator
    participant MQ as SQS
    participant EX as Execution Service
    participant BI as Billing Service
    participant MP as Mercado Pago

    Customer->>OS: POST /service-orders
    OS->>OS: Persist OS + Saga + Outbox
    OS-->>Customer: 202 OS recebida
    OS->>MQ: DiagnosisRequestedV1
    MQ->>EX: DiagnosisRequestedV1
    EX->>EX: Persist diagnosis + Inbox + Outbox
    EX->>MQ: DiagnosisCompletedV1
    MQ->>OS: DiagnosisCompletedV1
    OS->>OS: Advance Saga + Outbox
    OS->>MQ: QuoteGenerationRequestedV1
    MQ->>BI: QuoteGenerationRequestedV1
    BI->>BI: Persist quote snapshot + Inbox + Outbox
    BI->>MQ: QuoteGeneratedV1
    MQ->>OS: QuoteGeneratedV1
    OS->>OS: Set AGUARDANDO_APROVACAO
    Customer->>BI: Approve quote
    BI->>BI: Persist approval + Outbox
    BI->>MQ: QuoteApprovedV1
    MQ->>OS: QuoteApprovedV1
    OS->>MQ: ExecutionRequestedV1
    MQ->>EX: ExecutionRequestedV1
    EX->>EX: Execute and persist repair
    EX->>MQ: ExecutionCompletedV1
    MQ->>OS: ExecutionCompletedV1
    OS->>OS: Set FINALIZADA + Outbox
    OS->>MQ: PaymentCreationRequestedV1
    MQ->>BI: PaymentCreationRequestedV1
    BI->>MP: Create dynamic QR with idempotency key
    MP-->>BI: Payment order + qr_data
    BI->>BI: Persist pending payment + Outbox
    BI->>MQ: PaymentPendingV1
    MP->>BI: Webhook signal
    BI->>MP: Query authenticated payment status
    MP-->>BI: approved
    BI->>BI: Persist confirmation + Inbox + Outbox
    BI->>MQ: PaymentConfirmedV1
    MQ->>OS: PaymentConfirmedV1
    OS->>OS: Set ENTREGUE and complete Saga

    alt Failure before repair starts
        OS->>MQ: CancelExecutionV1 or CancelQuoteV1
        MQ-->>EX: Release operational reservation
        MQ-->>BI: Cancel pending quote or payment
        OS->>OS: Mark Saga compensated and OS cancelled
    else Failure after repair starts
        EX->>MQ: ExecutionFailedV1 requiring manual handling
        MQ->>OS: Failure event
        OS->>OS: Mark Saga manual intervention required
    else Confirmed payment requires reversal
        OS->>MQ: RefundPaymentV1 after explicit authorization
        MQ->>BI: RefundPaymentV1
        BI->>MP: Idempotent refund
        MP-->>BI: Refund status
        BI->>MQ: PaymentRefundedV1
    end
